        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2609-31, Quincy Double Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Quincy Double Robe Hook straddles the line between traditional and contemporary decor styles in the most fashionable way. This Transitional Double Pronged Hook will add class to any bathroom, be it personal or commercial. Bath Hooks like this one are handy for a wide array of uses. The Quincy Double Hook is most obviously used as a bath towel hook, but it can also be install in restrooms as a purse hook, a robe hook, or a hand towel hook. You could even install a few in the closet to hand bags, belts and other accessories. Choose from a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Quincy Bathroom Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-78\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
